{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7wIy6HJMf9V6iS3csTX7ig","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:29.102706+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7wIy6HJMf9V6iS3csTX7ig","html":"<div><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>中国科学院分子细胞科学卓越创新中心（以下简称“中心”），前身为生物化学与细胞生物学研究所，是我国生命科学领域最具科研实力和影响力的研究机构之一。七十余年来，经过几代科学家的不懈奋斗，中心先后取得了人工合成牛胰岛素、人工全合成酵母丙氨酸转移核糖核酸、卵母细胞的受精成熟与单性生殖、家鱼的人工繁殖等具有重大国际影响的原创性成果，多次荣获国家自然科学一等奖、科技进步一等奖。中心在国内享有崇高的科学声誉和社会影响力，同时也备受国际同行瞩目。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>中心致力于生命科学前沿基础研究与应用基础研究，依托核糖核酸功能与应用全国重点实验室、中国科学院多细胞体系结构与功能重点实验室、上海市分子男科学重点实验室，围绕基因调控、</span></span><span><span>RNA</span></span><span><span>与表观遗传学、蛋白质科学、细胞信号转导、细胞与干细胞生物学、癌症及其他重大疾病机理等领域开展前沿研究。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>近年来，中心高质量科研成果持续产出。</span></span><span><span>2019</span></span><span><span>年以来，以第一单位</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>通讯作者发表</span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span>论文约</span></span><span><span>1017</span></span><span><span>篇，其中在《科学》《细胞》《自然》期刊发表论文</span></span><span><span>34</span></span><span><span>篇，影响因子（</span></span><span><span>IF</span></span><span><span>）≥</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>的高水平论文约</span></span><span><span>503</span></span><span><span>篇；</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>项成果获国家自然科学奖二等奖，</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>项成果获上海市自然科学奖一等奖，</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>项成果入选年度“中国生命科学十大进展”。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>中心拥有一支高素质的创新人才队伍，现有</span></span><span><span>1000</span></span><span><span>余人从事科学研究，其中一线研究及技术支撑人员近</span></span><span><span>400</span></span><span><span>人，在学研究生与博士后</span></span><span><span>700</span></span><span><span>余人。研究组长</span></span><span><span>70</span></span><span><span>余名，形成了以朝气蓬勃、锐意创新的中青年为主体、老中青相结合的学术带头人队伍。其中，中国科学院院士</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>人、发展中国家科学院院士</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>人、国家杰出青年基金获得者</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>中心拥有</span><strong><span>生物学、基础医学</span></strong><span>两个一级学科培养点。生物学下设生物化学与分子生物学、细胞生物学、发育生物学、生物信息学等</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>个博士学位授权点，以及生物与医药专业硕士学位授权点；基础医学设有免疫学博士学位授权点。中心建有完善的研究生培养体系，推行创新的培养模式，包括</span></span><span><span>Bio2000</span></span><span><span>课程、实验室轮转、师生互选、研究生指导小组等，为生命科学前沿领域的研究生培养提供了坚实保障。中心学术氛围浓厚，研究生每年可参与多场高水平、高层次的国内外学术交流活动。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>中心研究生每年有</span></span><span><span>160</span></span><span><span>余人次荣获吴瑞奖学金、中国科学院优秀博士学位论文奖、中国科学院院长特别奖、中国科学院院长优秀奖、朱李月华奖学金、王应睐奖学金、国家奖学金等各类奖项。中心奖助学金体系优厚：博士生奖助学金为</span></span><span><span>6000</span></span><span><span>元</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>月，硕士生为</span></span><span><span>4500</span></span><span><span>元</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>月；另有全覆盖的学业奖学金，博士生平均</span></span><span><span>13000</span></span><span><span>元</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>年，硕士生平均</span></span><span><span>8000</span></span><span><span>元</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>年。历届优秀毕业生广泛分布于全国高校、科研院所、医院、企业和政府机关。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>中心设有分子生物学技术平台、细胞分析技术平台、化学生物学技术平台、动物实验技术平台、果蝇资源与技术平台、斑马鱼技术平台、细胞库</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>干细胞技术平台、生物信息学平台、</span></span><span><span>GTP</span></span><span><span>中心等</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>个技术平台。中心致力于在分子细胞科学基础与前沿领域不断追求卓越，力争在揭示细胞生命本质及活动规律方面取得重大突破，推动生命科学与技术发展，率先建成生命科学研究领域国际一流的研究中心和创新人才高地。我们热忱欢迎全国各高校优秀本科生加入中心，共同肩负国家科技战略力量的重任，为推动生命科学发展、实现科技强国梦、增进人民福祉贡献力量。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span>年中心计划招收</span></span><strong><span>学术型研究生</span></strong><span><span>（硕博连读）约</span></span></span><span><span>90</span></span><span><span><span>名，</span></span><strong><span>专业学位研究生</span></strong><span><span>约</span></span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>名。现启动推免生申请报名工作，具体申请办法如下。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>一</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何违法违纪受处分记录，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果等学术不端行为。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>坚持德智体美劳全面发展，具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会责任感强，具备良好的团队合作精神。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>生命科学、医学、化学、药学、数学、计算机、人工智能等相关专业的全日制</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生，且预计能在本科就读学校获得推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，热爱科学事业，对生命科学、基础医学、</span></span><span><span>AI+Bio</span></span><span><span>等领域有强烈志趣，有较强的创新意识和专业能力，有志于从事科学研究工作，并具备较好的研究潜质。科研成果突出者，学习成绩标准可适当放宽。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>英语水平良好，达到国家大学英语六级考试（</span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>425</span></span><span><span>分及以上，或大学英语四级考试（</span></span><span><span>CET-4</span></span><span><span>）成绩优秀（如</span></span><span><span>550</span></span><span><span>分及以上）；或具有同等水平的其他外语能力证明。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7.</span></span><span><span>身体健康符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>二</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请办法</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）网上报名</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>报名方式：登录中心研究生教育网（</span></span><span>http://www.sibcb.ac.cn/edu/</span><span><span><span>），点击左侧“夏令营</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>推免生报名”图标进入在线报名系统，或直接访问</span></span></span><span>https://edu.sibcb.ac.cn/enroll_student/</span><span><span>进行填报。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>报名截止时间：</span></span><span><strong><span>2026</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>年</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>8</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>月</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>30</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>日</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>20:00</span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）报名材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）身份证正反面复印件、学生证姓名页复印件（必须）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）成绩单（需加盖教务处公章；如学校暂时无法开具，可先从教务系统下载打印，补交原件时间另行通知）（必须）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）英语等级证书（必须）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）获奖证书；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）其他自愿提供的材料：成绩排名证明、推荐信、已发表的论文或专利、其他原创性工作成果等有参考价值的材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>请按以上顺序，将全部材料整合为一份</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件，命名为“高校名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>手机号”，上传至报名系统的“其他”栏目。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>三</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>选拔程序</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>自报名开始，中心将分批进行材料审核、分批组织选拔，具体安排将通过电子邮件发送，请注意及时查收。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>入选学生须按通知要求到中心报到，并提交全部报名材料的原件以备查验。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>来中心期间，中心提供食堂餐券；来沪差旅及住宿须自行解决。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>入选学生须在获得所在高校推荐免试资格后，按教育部要求在规定时间内登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（网址：</span></span></span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span>，以下简称“推免服务系统”）完成报考、复试及拟录取确认等手续。未在规定时间内完成确认手续者，视为自动放弃拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>思想品德和综合素质考核不合格者不予推荐和录取；所有申请材料须真实有效，凡弄虚作假或有其他不端行为者，一经查实，即取消申请资格或录取资格，由此产生的一切后果由申请者本人承担。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>四</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>已参加中心</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年夏令营并获得优秀营员资格的学生，无需再次申请。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>中心</span></span><strong><span>专业学位硕士研究生</span></strong><span><span>按照报考研究方向直接定组，不参加实验室轮转。招生导师介绍请见</span></span></span></span><span>http://www.sibcb.ac.cn/edu/news1.jsp?ID=1588</span><span><span>（可扫描下方二维码）</span></span><span><span>，也可进入网站</span></span><span>http://sjzx.sibcb.ac.cn/</span><span><span>，点击【技术平台】进入各技术平台团队查询相关介绍。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibCCwqBmwuFSN27rWPE5lanPJ2hUzoFl94KZe56xzUPyJxybGLBnwpyCUdmicXzunEGfWto3PbKhnSCXUtKMsWdvAfXytuBzZopmv9tSLJRww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>申请者应认真填写各项信息，确保所填信息完整、准确。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>所有必填项填写完整后方可保存，报名系统中如某必填项无内容，可填写“</span></span><span><span>0”</span></span><span><span>或“无”。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>报名时请务必准确填写并认真核对手机号码和电子邮箱，以免影响通知接收。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.</span></span><span><span>如遇无法注册、系统报错、提交失败等问题，请发送电子邮件至</span></span></span><span><span>yjs@sibcb.ac.cn</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>五</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><span>联系人：李老师、马老师</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span>021-54921608 / 54921386</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>yjs@sibcb.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地址：上海市岳阳路</span></span><span><span>320</span></span><span><span>号</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮编：</span></span><span><span>200031</span></span></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8ba9272b878bd4a97b4a1aebd663c2f48141499b5fd98570b3ce02716d67e821","textLength":2969,"sourceSha256":"e65ca93d298bdd6bd7d6248260e2dd97a7c1c0262e501db81644d0c65afae9f0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6a61310d655871365d86","title":"2026年中国科学院分子细胞科学卓越创新中心2027年入学推免生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:29.102706+00:00"}
